Third-party attributions
================================================================================

Tasks.org (Tasks)
-----------------
The billing and entitlement abstractions under `core/billing` use field names
chosen to match Tasks.org. No Tasks.org source code is included, and no
copyrightable expression from it has been copied. The naming is recorded as
`SPEC-COMPATIBLE` in docs/legal/PROVENANCE.md and in
config/legal/provenance-registry.tsv, and the reasoning is in
docs/decisions/2026-09-23-billing-abstractions.md.

Orgzly
------
The task search and query language under `feature/search/query/` was derived
from Orgzly's query grammar, which is GPL-3.0. The implementation in this
repository is an independent rewrite against a written specification
(docs/specs/search-query-grammar.md); no Orgzly source is included. Recorded
as `REWRITTEN` in docs/legal/PROVENANCE.md and
config/legal/provenance-registry.tsv, and the derivation is disclosed in the
code itself.

